title: "ZAMICORE v2.3: Deterministic Cognitive Operating System on FreeBSD and OpenZFS"
abstract: "A deterministic open cognitive operating system specification and substrate decoupling logic, memory, and reasoning from neural model weights using OpenZFS 4KB strata Merkle-DAG, AVX2 FSM primitives, and hardware-enforced epistemic interlocks."
